### 1. GET alle deltagere - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere
Api-Key: topsecret


### 2. GET alle deltagere - 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere
Api-Key: feilnokkel


### 3. GET én deltager - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere/12345678
Api-Key: topsecret


### 4. GET én deltager - 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere/12345678
Api-Key: feilnokkel


### 5. GET én deltager - 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere/99999999
Api-Key: topsecret


### 6. POST ny deltager - 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere
Api-Key: topsecret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobil": "87654321",
  "passord": "abcd1234",
  "fornavn": "Anna",
  "etternavn": "Hansen",
  "kjonn": "kvinne"
}


### 7. POST ny deltager - 401 Unauthorized
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deltagere
Api-Key: feilnokkel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobil": "87654322",
  "passord": "abcd1234",
  "fornavn": "Ola",
  "etternavn": "Nordmann",
  "kjonn": "mann"
}


